<title>USA: Standard Micro acquires Cardbus line.</title>
<headline>Standard Micro acquires Cardbus line.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Microsystems Corp said Monday it had acquired the Cardbus technology and product line of Danvers, Mass.-based Databook Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>Standard Microsystems said its Component Products Division had been a licensee of Databook's Cardbus technology.</p>
<p>The acquisition will result in a new design center team in the Boston area, it said. Standard Microsystems expects the first new Cardbus product design from the team in the 1997 first half, it said.</p>
</text>
